Hi, I have an Intel ProWireless 4965 and I'm experiencing an annoying
problem with it. This card works great with networks 802.11g/n but it
has a very slow downloading speed with 802.11b networks. The module
loaded is iwlagn and I've tested a lot of version of it without getting
any improvement. I've tried with compat-wireless (2008-12-08 is my last
versione tested) but the results are always the same. In particular I
can't obtain a download speed greater then 80 KB, with the same provider
but using a cable I can download at 500 KB. Even if 802.11b is not so
common I think this is a serious problem. Attached to my mail you'll
find some log files with informations about my system, in particular
I've attached my modinfo, my lspci and other information about kernel
I'm using. I hope that you can find a solution, if you need other from
me just ask!
Cheers, Cesare.

--=-P01kvHGzILiFs4dYDF9J
